+The `report` command prints category totals for a month:
+
+```
+tally report --month 2024-03
+tally report --month 2024-03 --category food
+```
+
+Leaving off `--month` shows totals across all months. Passing `--category`
+narrows the output to a single category.
+
+The `list` command shows the individual entries rather than the totals, with the
+same filtering options:
 
